{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean Break</strong> is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memory, and the quiet violence of letting go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a seemingly ordinary home. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break furniture that doesn\u2019t belong. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the house begins to change, so does your understanding of what you\u2019re <i>really</i>\u00a0breaking. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surreal 20 minute journey through grief, memory, and emotional cleanup.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828850?t=1753588693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828850/bafcad5c154cc72aef5d2715cc959b781d319a7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753588693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828850/e03247423230a28f9d1603dc2350611fcee778e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753588693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828850/e03247423230a28f9d1603dc2350611fcee778e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753588693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean Break</strong> is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memory, and the quiet violence of lett